<title>UK: Eurotunnel sees much higher 97 revenues.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel sees much higher 97 revenues.</headline>
<dateline>FOLKESTONE, England 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel Plc's chairman, Patrick Ponsolle, said on Monday he expected revenues for 1997 to be &quot;substantially higher&quot; than 1996 which meant the group was &quot;cautiously optimistic for 1998.&quot;</p>
<p>Ponsolle was speaking at a press briefing in Folkstone, England on the performance of the group in 1996 and the likely outlook for 1997 following the fire which caused serious damage in one of its tunnel's last November.</p>
